#           prompt: >-
#             /audit-bundle build/cli.bundle against build/baseline.bundle
#
#             This is a pre-signing audit. build/cli.bundle is the unsigned bundle this
#             workflow just built for ${{ github.repository }} and is about to sign;
#             build/baseline.bundle is the currently published release, already verified
#             as genuinely signed by this workflow. If the baseline file is absent, review
#             every member instead and say so.
#
#             Use diff mode: review what changed, and call out every member added or
#             removed even when each individual diff looks harmless. Write the
#             machine-readable verdict to build/cli.audit.json, including baselineSha256
#             when you reviewed a diff. The build gates on that file and will not sign
